WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:04.852
ANNE
Yes?

00:00:04.903 --> 00:00:06.350
SHANNON
Hi! I have some bad news.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:07.516
We lost your mom.

00:00:07.567 --> 00:00:08.356
ANNE
What?

00:00:08.406 --> 00:00:10.919
SHANNON
Sorry, that was terrible phrasing.

00:00:10.969 --> 00:00:12.815
I meant we don't
know where she is.

00:00:12.865 --> 00:00:13.524
ANNE
[Sigh]

00:00:15.521 --> 00:00:17.354
SUNNYVALE WORKER
Ah, I think your sister's here.

00:00:17.405 --> 00:00:19.049
JENNY
Annie, it's finally happened.

00:00:19.099 --> 00:00:21.145
Oh my God. It's okay.
It's okay, I'm here!

00:00:21.195 --> 00:00:23.025
We're orphans... Oh my God,
you're Orphan Annie! Oh my God!

00:00:23.075 --> 00:00:26.316
ANNE
She's not dead! She ran away.

00:00:26.366 --> 00:00:27.370
JENNY
That bitch.

00:00:28.326 --> 00:00:30.287
KEN
Anne Yum! Your mom owes me 80 grand.

00:00:30.337 --> 00:00:32.422
When you have it,
you'll get your dog back.

00:00:32.685 --> 00:00:33.881
ANNE
I don't have any money.

00:00:33.932 --> 00:00:35.448
JENNY
You could sell your eggs.

00:00:35.498 --> 00:00:36.560
I mean, it's not like
you're using them.

00:00:36.611 --> 00:00:37.915
ANNE
No! There has to be another way.

00:00:38.623 --> 00:00:40.802
AUDIENCE
Can't stop the quiz!

00:00:40.853 --> 00:00:42.628
TERRY
What is the square root of 196?

00:00:42.678 --> 00:00:43.474
ANNE
14.

00:00:43.525 --> 00:00:44.424
TERRY
Correct. How many hearts

00:00:44.474 --> 00:00:45.590
does an octopus have?

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:46.268
- 3.
- Correct.

00:00:46.318 --> 00:00:46.814
JENNY
What?

00:00:46.814 --> 00:00:47.706
ANNE
Saffron. Saturn.

00:00:47.756 --> 00:00:50.995
Aphrodite, Apollo, Ares.
Carbon dioxide. The equal sign.

00:00:51.045 --> 00:00:51.606
[Bell dinging]

00:00:51.656 --> 00:00:52.156
TERRY
Correct!

00:00:52.198 --> 00:00:53.183
JENNY
Oh my God!

00:00:53.233 --> 00:00:53.733
ANNE
What?

00:00:53.741 --> 00:00:54.808
JENNY
You know this game.

00:00:54.858 --> 00:00:55.939
This is how you're
going to make the money!

00:00:55.989 --> 00:00:57.365
I'm taking you to the Quiz!

00:00:57.416 --> 00:00:58.364
ANNE
Look out!

00:00:58.415 --> 00:00:59.075
[Screaming]

00:01:00.603 --> 00:01:01.568
MAN IN TRUCK
Learn how to drive!

00:01:02.348 --> 00:01:03.027
JENNY
Racist!

00:01:03.778 --> 00:01:05.621
Oh, hi!

00:01:06.468 --> 00:01:08.540
JENNY
Come on! It's going to be fun!

00:01:08.591 --> 00:01:09.536
I'm not sleeping on the floor.

00:01:09.587 --> 00:01:10.787
ANNE
I'm not sleeping on the floor either.

00:01:10.838 --> 00:01:12.024
JENNY
Then sleep on the chair!

00:01:12.748 --> 00:01:13.551
ANNE
I don't want to sleep

00:01:13.601 --> 00:01:14.660
in a sitting position!

00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:15.337
JENNY
Oh my God.

00:01:15.388 --> 00:01:17.903
♫ Hold up
About to catch another flight ♫

00:01:17.953 --> 00:01:19.578
ANNE
I can't play on live TV

00:01:19.628 --> 00:01:20.510
in front of millions of people.

00:01:20.561 --> 00:01:21.467
RON
I'll let you get to it.

00:01:21.517 --> 00:01:22.517
I know you gotta get
through hair and makeup.

00:01:22.568 --> 00:01:23.531
ANNE
I already went through hair and makeup.

00:01:23.581 --> 00:01:25.009
RON
Well, then you missed a spot.

00:01:25.060 --> 00:01:26.067
♫ Ladies getting money
all around the world ♫

00:01:26.118 --> 00:01:27.270
ANNE
I can't do this. Am I sweating?

00:01:27.321 --> 00:01:29.432
JENNY
Yeah. You know what? Put your arms down.

00:01:29.482 --> 00:01:31.779
You're having a panic attack.
Doctors prescribe these.

00:01:31.830 --> 00:01:33.167
ANNE
Is that cocaine?

00:01:33.217 --> 00:01:35.323
JENNY
[Laughing]

00:01:35.373 --> 00:01:39.021
Stevia. Do you ever use stevia?
The sweetener? Yeah, yeah.

00:01:39.084 --> 00:01:39.944
I've got it in my pocket.

00:01:41.788 --> 00:01:43.993
♫ Yeah
'Cause girls is players too ♫

00:01:45.073 --> 00:01:46.035
BEN FRANKLIN
Oh!

00:01:46.835 --> 00:01:48.817
ANNE
Win or lose, we'll do it together.

00:01:49.781 --> 00:01:50.715
[Screaming]

00:01:50.765 --> 00:01:52.271
ANNE
That is definitely broken.

00:01:52.321 --> 00:01:53.791
JENNY
I bet you I can pop it back in myself.

00:01:54.447 --> 00:01:55.428
ANNE
No, I can't.

00:01:55.479 --> 00:01:56.659
I'm going to throw up.

00:01:56.710 --> 00:01:59.683
♫ Ladies getting money all around
the world 'cause girls is players too ♫

00:01:59.734 --> 00:02:01.227
JENNY
How can I ever thank you?

00:02:01.278 --> 00:02:03.306
Maybe, like, a drink later?

00:02:03.356 --> 00:02:05.381
DOCTOR
Well I'm married... and gay.

00:02:06.033 --> 00:02:07.476
JENNY
Why'd you have to say two reasons?

